#: ../../source/plugins/part_types.rst:139
msgid "The part built by the box partType, shown in the Digital Thread"
msgstr ""
"La pieza construida por el partType box, mostrada en el Digital Thread"

#: ../../source/plugins/part_types.rst:144
msgid ""
"``box`` is absent from ``pc list parts``, because it is a ``partType`` and "
"not a part -- PartCAD counts the two as different kinds of object "
"(``partType`` is one of the ten in ``Project.OBJECT_KINDS``), and only one "
"of them is a shape."
msgstr ""
"``box`` no aparece en ``pc list parts``, porque es un ``partType`` y no una "
"pieza -- PartCAD cuenta los dos como tipos de objeto distintos (``partType``"
" es uno de los diez de ``Project.OBJECT_KINDS``), y solo uno de ellos es una"
" forma."
